window.products.push({"id":1182338,"name":"3ple Decker Case for Arduino (Low,Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x1YykKBlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description In order to protect your beloved Arduino, this is the perfect light weight accessory with unique functionalities designed specifically for the Arduino. ・Our elegant case is compatible with Arduino UNO,   Arduino Leonardo,Genuino UNO,Genuino 101.・Excellent detachability between modules that can stack in multiple stages.    Using 3ple Decker series, you can create an integrated system by stacking    the microcomputer board module and various modules by performing simple    wiring and programming.・Seven color variations among them black and white are flame retardant,    all other transparent colors are non-flame retardant.・Air vents allow cool air to flow over the surface of the board, and exit      through the top of the case. ・This case has GPIO cover which will Protects your Arduino while leaving you     access to all ports and GPIO headers,which will also protect the board from short   circuit. Without GPIO cover,freely can do electrical work. . Contents ・Enclosure for Arduino (Low,Black) ・Arduino board adapter (attached to the case) ・Rubber feet(it prevents the case from slipping while working) ,screws & nuts,pins for stacking・Upper opening lid 2 types (one is already attached)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x1YykKBlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PhysicalComputingLab","source_asin":"B075SY64RS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182338","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075SY64RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B075SY64RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1182339,"name":"Garmin GLO 2 Bluetooth GPS Receiver 010-02184-01 with Garmin Dashboard Friction Mount Bundle","category":"electronics","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7101uc3uyWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Navigate with Garmin caliber GPS data on the mobile device of your choice. The GLO 2 receiver brings you the best of both worlds by combining GPS and GLONASS receivers with Bluetooth wireless technology so you can enjoy precise position information on your iPad, iPhone or Android device. The Accuracy of GPS and GLONASS GLO 2 can receive position information from both the GPS and GLONASS satellite constellations, allowing it to connect to up to 24 more satellites than devices that rely on GPS alone. This allows GLO 2 to lock on to satellites approximately 20% faster and remain connected even at high speed. What’s more, GLO 2 updates its position information at 10 times per second; that’s up to 10 times more often than the GPS receivers in many mobile devices. Set it Up and Go Using Bluetooth technology, the GLO 2 receiver wirelessly pairs to your mobile device. Just set GLO 2 within range of your mobile device, and in moments, you’ll be receiving the GLO 2 receiver’s position data. It has up to 13 hours of battery life to keep your position on long trips, and charging GLO 2 between uses is easy with the included USB cable or optional 12/24 V vehicle power cable. The optional friction mount keeps the receiver safe on your dashboard and in full view of satellites. 6-Month Garmin Pilot Subscription Select the bundle to turn your iPad or iPhone into the ideal cockpit companion. A 6-month subscription to the Garmin Pilot app puts full-featured navigation — including our decades of experience with rich, interactive mapping, 3D Vision, aviation weather, global flight plan filing, electronic flight bag capabilities, optional traffic/weather, pilot logbook and more — right at your fingertips. Please note that this item comes in a plain black and white box from Garmin, this is how it comes direct from Garmin. Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7101uc3uyWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garmin","source_asin":"B07NF43R6F","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182339","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NF43R6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NF43R6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
