window.products.push({"id":1182365,"name":"Arris DG1670A Touchstone Data Gateway Bulk Packed","category":"electronics","retail price":31.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11+l3Nf56XL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Touchstone DG1670 DOCSIS 3.0 Data Gateway is a 16x4 advanced gateway product. The DG1670 combines a 4-port Gigabit Router and 802.11n wireless access point with two independent simultaneously operating 802.11n radios into a single device capable of support both home and small office applications. Operators strive to push the limits on DOCSIS 3.0 performance delivered to the customer with both the Ethernet and the wireless interfaces. The two 802.11n radios create two concurrently operating wireless networks on both 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz frequency bands. The improved antennas provide increased flexibility and throughput and deliver unprecedented performance while also offering improvements in home coverage above those of previous technologies. Arris provides cable operators the highest levels of satisfaction with the setup, management, and Total Cost of Ownership (TCO), and has improved on these qualities with the 1670. The DG1670 distinguishes itself with capabilities that minimize an operator’s support needs. Multiple provisioning methods (SNMP, Configuration File, Remote WebGUI access, TR069, and TFTP) allow a custom designed setup to be efficiently applied to the end user. The Arris implementation of TR069 capabilities allows a cable operator to more easily monitor, configure, and troubleshoot the home network providing best in class service for home and business users. Multiple local and remote access levels (User, Technician) also allow more ease and flexibility for manual configuration and control. Please check with your service provider for compatibility prior to purchasing. Bulk Packed retail version IS NOT available. Bulk packed means NO box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11+l3Nf56XL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARRIS","source_asin":"B00MI7JU72","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182365","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MI7JU72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MI7JU72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
