window.products.push({"id":1182418,"name":"Circuit City Professional Digital Photography Filter Kit (UV, CPL, ND4) for Camera Lens with 77MM Filter Thread + Filter Pouch","category":"electronics","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-7QDQzw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBILITY: Designed and optimized to be used with all digital camera lens brands with a 77MM filter thread such as Canon, Fuji, Leica, Nikon, Olympus, Panasonic, Pentax and Sony. TAKE YOUR PICTURES TO THE NEXT LEVEL: Whether you’re an amateur or experienced, this filter set includes everything you need to take your pictures to the next level of sharpness, clarity and beauty. This is an ideal kit to add to your lenses. UV FILTER: Leave the UV Filter on at all times. It keeps harmful moisture or dust from reaching your lens and prevents scratching. A simple, clear filter that absorbs ultraviolet light and reduces the blue cast of normal daylight. It is designed for general use, with no adjustments to exposure needed. Multiple layers of coating help keep it sharp and clean. The multiple layers also help prevent ghosting or reflections in your shots. CIRCULAR POLARIZER FILTER: Helps reduce reflections and glare by filtering out polarized light due to reflections from non-metallic surfaces. Sunlight becomes partially polarized due to reflecting off electrons in air molecules, causing the light to scatter into what appears as haze. A polarizing filter arranges and filters this directionally polarized light. This results in a reduction of glare and reflections and an increase in the saturation of skies and foliage. NEUTRAL DENSITY FILTER: If you take pictures that need to capture movement, the neutral density filter is the key. This filter controls the depth of the photo’s field. When you’re taking a nature shot of a waterfall, rapids or a river, this filter illustrates their movement. If you’re looking to capture a beautiful cloud filled sky or fast-moving cars, the same is true. It does this by slowing your exposure time and increasing the aperture (by two stops of light.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-7QDQzw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circuit City","source_asin":"B076PS39PC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182418","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076PS39PC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B076PS39PC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1182419,"name":"Wireless Bluetooth Mouse for Apple iPad iPhone MacBook Android Samsung Tablet Phone Dual-Mode Rechargeable 2.4G Portable Computer Mice for Windows Lap","category":"electronics","retail price":8.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rwPRqqt0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual-Mode mouse: Bluetooth + 2.4GHz connection Note: You need to update the system of your ipad and iphone to iOS 13, iPad OS 13 and above. And then turn on “Assistive Touch” : Open Setting > Accessibility > Touch > Assistive Touch. 1. Bluetooth mouse connection method: 1: Turn on the ON/OFF switch to switch to Bluetooth. 2: Turn on the Bluetooth switch of mobile device such as tablet/smartphone, and then search for the Bluetooth mouse. 3: Click the Bluetooth mouse on the tablet/smartphone to connect to the device. Note: The mouse can't be connected to two Bluetooth devices at the same time. Therefore, if you want to replace another device, you must first disconnect the pairing connection of the original device. 2. 2.4G mouse connection method: 1: Turn on the ON/OFF switch to switch to 2.4G. 2: Just plug the USB receiver into the USB port of the computer and you can start using it.  Compatible with iPhone such as iPhone 12 Pro Max mini, iPhone SE 2020, iPhone 11 Pro Max, iPhone X XR XS Max etc. Compatible with iPad such as iPad Pro 9.7/10.5, iPad Pro 12.9 inch 2nd 3rd 4th 5th gen, iPad Pro 11 inch 1st 2nd 3rd generation, iPad Air 3rd gen 10.5, 4th gen 10.9, iPad mini 2/ 3/ 4/ 5 2019, iPad 4th 5th 6th gen 9.7, 7th 8th generation 10.2 2020 etc. Compatible with Android tablet smartphone such as Samsung Galaxy Tab a a7 s6 lite s7 plus s7+ S etc. Product Specifications: Bluetooth Version: Bluetooth 5.2 DPI: 800-1200-1600 Buttons: 4 keys Working distance: Up to 10 meters Charging Interface: Micro USB Package including: 1 * Wireless Bluetooth Mouse 1 * USB Receiver 1 * USB Cable  If you have any questions, please contact us. We provide one year warranty service, so you do not have any risk. If you are not satisfied with our products, we can replace you with a brand new product or a full refund to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rwPRqqt0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xukinroy","source_asin":"B0995Y6G6H","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182419","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995Y6G6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995Y6G6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
