window.products.push({"id":1182606,"name":"MADE Products CA-1110-BLK Lens Armor (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XXxl083DL._AC_.jpg","description":"The toughest protection for your camera: We custom design each of our cases to fit the camera like a glove. All controls and access points are still accessible and you can use your camera at a moments notice. No more missed photographs trying to get your camera out of its case. Rubberized lens hood stretches to fit lenses from 48mm up to 77mm filter size, provides protection from knocks and bumps. Can be pushed back to prevent vignetting. Comes with a convenient lens cap lanyard to prevent you from losing the lens cap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XXxl083DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Made Products","source_asin":"B000NZOTD6","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182606","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NZOTD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NZOTD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1182607,"name":"Wyze Cam Outdoor Starter Bundle (Base Station and 1 Cam), 1080p HD Indoor/Outdoor Wire-Free Smart Home Camera with Night Vision, 2-Way Audio, Works wi","category":"electronics","retail price":66.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513b9fxIRnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our customers have inspired us over the last two years with videos of meteors racing across the sky, sunsets over mountain ranges we thought only existed in movies, and visits from mother nature in the form of wildlife and spectacular lightning storms. They’ve stretched the limits of our indoor camera with use cases we never anticipated and conditions we thought impossible. They made makeshift outdoor housings out of milk jugs, 3D printings, and bird houses. They’re tenacity to go beyond our prescribed instruction has made it clear we need to meet them with a camera that can keep up with their curiosity. Capturing the world can’t happen when you’re limited to your living room, so we created a camera that goes beyond that. We spent two years on phone calls that carried into the next morning; on international flights where sleep became a luxury; and on user interviews listening to what you wanted to see in an outdoor camera. All leading up to a camera worthy of looking after your home and those within it. We cut wires, removed boundaries, and lab tested under every extreme condition imaginable. We’ve built you a battle-hardened camera capable of going places your indoor camera wouldn’t even dream about—thriving in the rains of Seattle all the way to the heatwaves of Miami and everything in between. Performance-packed hardware and software found in cameras 3x the price weren’t added to win an award. They were added to earn your respect. Sensor: 1/2.7’","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513b9fxIRnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WYZE","source_asin":"B09V28P31X","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182607","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V28P31X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V28P31X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
