window.products.push({"id":1182611,"name":"USB Flash Drive Photo Stick, WIVIC USB 3.0 Memory Stick for Photos, 128GB Photostick Thumb Drive Compatible with Phone/iPad/iOS/Android/Mac/PC (Pink)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711XOy4B78S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of storage warnings on your phone? Are you still worried about the lack of internal storage space for your phone? It is a usb flash drive for phone with 4 in 1 connectors that can transmit files for all phone products. Protect your privacy: Enable all data to be protected by password and touch ID, your privacy will not be stolen even you lose the flash drive. Mini Size and easy to carry: Light weight,as small as lipsticks,key-chain hole makes it easy to carry when you on trip. Watch Video Directly and Share to Social Media: Light weight Plug and play, you can watch the movie directly on the flash drive 128 gb. You can also share your photos on social media directly from your usb storage when you take nice pictures during your trip. --Warm tips: Flash drive for iOS needs to download a free app “LUV-Share”, you can search the app from the App Store. (When the usb flash drive cannot be recognized by Phone, you can try to plug the front and back of the port and try more times. Or try this: Exit all apps in the background of the Phone＞Uninstall ''LUV-Share'' app＞Turn Phone off for a minute and then turn it on＞Download ''LUV-Share'' app from the App Store＞Try plugging the usb drive into the Phone) f you've used iCloud before to back up your files, you'll need to download the files from iCloud to your Phone or iPad and then copy them to usb flash drive. Android phones need to support the OTG function. Most Android device with OTG function, can use flash drive directly when plugging, can find the flash drive on your device in : File Manager. (The usb flash drive is equipped with a type-c adapter for the latest Android phones) If your phone doesn't work, you need to open the phone set to open the OTG connection. For any questions about our flash drive, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with 24-hour best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711XOy4B78S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WIVIC","source_asin":"B091CCKTFX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182611","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091CCKTFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B091CCKTFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
