window.products.push({"id":1182975,"name":"Asurion 2-Year Lawn & Garden Protection Plan ($700-$800)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fN-dpClGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Why pay for repairs when you don't have to? Get a Canopy Protection Plan Coverage includes Free Repairs , and No Deductibles Free Repairs Easy To Get Simple To Use Hassle-Free Claims  24/7/365 Your Plan Pays For Itself If we can't fix it,we'll replace it(see details)2-Way shipping or in-home service includedNo deductible.No papers to file.On your very firstbreakdown   Join over 153 million people who already have a plan to avoid paying for unexpected repairs . Canopy Coverage Protect your products!  Add Canopy Protection to your purchase Did you know ... ? You can add a Canopy plan to products within 30 days of purchase date. We cover failures due to: Power surges  Mechanical or electrical breakdowns - even from nomal wear and tear  Internal heat, dust and humidity  Defects in materials and workmanship  Limitations and exclusions apply. See terms and conditions for full program details. Everyone always jokes that things break down the day after the manufacturer warranty expires . Guess what? It happened to me! Luckily, I had a Canopy extended protection plan. Not only did it spare me from the hassle and frustration, the plan actually saved me money! The Canopy Protection Plan works when your product doesn't. But it only works, if you have it. Here's How Your Canopy Plan Works Simply add a Canopy Protection Plan to your shopping cart. You'll receive an email confirming your purchase. Make a copy before you really need it. Tip: If your product arrives late, just call us and your plan will be extended by two weeks to allow for delivery time of the product. We're here for you. You can file a claim online at www.canopyprotection.com, or by phone, at 1-866-551-5924. Just have your original receipt or other proof-of-purchase handy.    Canopy has exclusive dedicated support forAmazon.comcustomers. Protection Without Paperwork Canopy Protection Plan documents will be sent after purchase to the email address associated with your Amazon.com account, so a permanent record will remain in your email folder. It's everything you need to get a product repaired or replaced in one streamlined step. You may wish to register your plan online at www.canopyprotection.com or call (866) 551-5924. Doing so will allow a quicker claims process should you need to file a claim. If Canopy documents don't arrive, just call (866) 551-5924 anytime, day or night.  With over 250 million service contracts in effect,our customer ratingrepresents a lot ofhappy people. Details If we can't repair your product, we'll replace it with a new or refurbished product with similar features and functionality, or with an Amazon.com Gift Card for the original purchase price of the product (plus tax). For smaller products, a prepaid shipping label will be provided. For larger items, a technician will be sent to your home to repair your product. 2-Way Shipping Included MKT50004","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fN-dpClGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASURION","source_asin":"B0083J9HEA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1182975","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0083J9HEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0083J9HEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
